        "Type": 301,
        "BeginAnim": "AniZhuanchangEnd",
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Asimov",
            "The analysis of her M.I.N.D. and frame is complete. Still, I'd recommend bringing her back to Babylonia for a more detailed inspection.",
