    {
        "Id": 95,
        "ActionId": 95,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "Let's start with the conclusion. Lucia's infection happened because her frame's data was transforming to its original form—the data from Alpha's frame.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 96,
        "ActionId": 96,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "In a sense, she's transforming into an Ascendant. That's why the Plume frame is starting to absorb the Punishing Virus.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 97,
        "ActionId": 97,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "As if dropping a massive stone into the water, Asimov's words stir up a tidal wave within Nikola and Hassen. They have considered many possibilities, but what Asimov said is still beyond what they imagined."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 98,
        "ActionId": 98,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "Although Plume's data originated from the Ascendant Alpha, much data was altered during its development.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 99,
        "ActionId": 99,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "We made those changes because we wanted to protect its user but also because we couldn't reproduce and recover parts of the original data.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 100,
        "ActionId": 100,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "These parts of the data could be affected by factors we haven't found.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 101,
        "ActionId": 101,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "Comparing Plume's early data with the original data and the one we just collected...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 102,
        "ActionId": 102,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "One thing we can be certain of is that the altered data is attempting to transform back to its original form.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 103,
        "ActionId": 103,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "That was the reason why 【kuroname】 appeared to have a Mind Beacon corruption during the connection.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 104,
        "ActionId": 104,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "Also, Lucia's Inver-Device is constantly receiving signals from a signal source.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 105,
        "ActionId": 105,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "Our early estimate is that these signals are related to the changes in the Plume frame, and they are affecting Lucia's M.I.N.D.",
