    },
    {
        "Id": 109,
        "ActionId": 109,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Hassen",
            "Is there no way to block these signals?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 110,
        "ActionId": 110,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "The signals are transmitted in a similar way to the electromagnetic radiation of the Hetero Tower. We can't block them completely with existing technologies.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 111,
        "ActionId": 111,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "We couldn't even find out that her Inver-Device was receiving some sort of signal if we didn't compare the data against the past records of electromagnetic radiation.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 112,
        "ActionId": 112,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hassen",
            "If I remember correctly, Hyperreal is completely immune to Punishing Virus, isn't it? Can we use that technology on Lucia?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 113,
        "ActionId": 113,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "Hyperreal's immunity comes from the Omega Weapon installed within the frame.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 114,
        "ActionId": 114,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "But the Omega Weapon is not an ordinary device. To install it inside Plume would be just as difficult as designing an all-new frame for Lucia.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 115,
        "ActionId": 115,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "Besides, the root cause of Lucia's problem comes from the change in frame parameters. The absorption of Punishing Virus is but a side product.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 116,
        "ActionId": 116,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "It wouldn't fix the problem in her M.I.N.D. either.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 117,
        "ActionId": 117,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hassen",
            "Do you have a solution then?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 118,
        "ActionId": 118,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "There are two.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 119,
        "ActionId": 119,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "The first is to completely remove the Inver-Device.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 120,
        "ActionId": 120,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "I did some testings. After turning off the Inver-Device completely, the parameters and M.I.N.D. of Plume no longer had abnormal fluctuations.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 121,
        "ActionId": 121,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "Which means if we remove Lucia's Inver-Device, the \"signal receiver,\" her problem will disappear.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 122,
        "ActionId": 122,
        "Type": 202,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 123,
        "ActionId": 123,
        "Type": 201,
        "Params": [
            1,
            500012,
            "",
            -400
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 124,
        "ActionId": 124,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Nikola",
            "But that will make her completely vulnerable to Punishing Virus. She won't be able to undertake any more combat missions.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 125,
        "ActionId": 125,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "I see. If you don't want to go down that path, we will have to turn off the signal. The second solution is to completely destroy the source of signals.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 126,
        "ActionId": 126,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Asimov opens a map."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 127,
        "ActionId": 127,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "While we haven't deciphered the method of transmission, we can locate the approximate range of the source.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 128,
        "ActionId": 128,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "He zooms into a particular region and draws a circle."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 129,
        "ActionId": 129,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nikola",
            "So this is where the signals come from...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 130,
        "ActionId": 130,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "Somewhere around this region. If we can get a little closer, we can better locate its exact position through Lucia.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 131,
        "ActionId": 131,
        "Type": 202,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 132,
        "ActionId": 132,
        "Type": 201,
        "Params": [
            1,
            500011,
            5,
            -400
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 133,
        "ActionId": 133,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Hassen",
            "What impact will it have on her?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 134,
        "ActionId": 134,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "Based on the data collected so far, as Lucia approaches the source, the signal strength will also increase, leading to an increased receiving power.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 135,
        "ActionId": 135,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "I can add a blocker to her Inver-Device through remote operation. It won't block the signals completely, but it can at least alleviate her symptoms.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 136,
        "ActionId": 136,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "We just need to destroy the signal source during this time.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 137,
        "ActionId": 137,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hassen",
            "Do you have any idea what this source is exactly?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 138,
        "ActionId": 138,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "The available data isn't enough for us to find out its actual shape or form.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 139,
        "ActionId": 139,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "That is to say, this source can be something totally unknown. Maybe it doesn't even have a physical form that can be destroyed.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 140,
        "ActionId": 140,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hassen",
            "Will this signal impact other specialized frames?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 141,
        "ActionId": 141,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "There isn't sufficient evidence.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 142,
        "ActionId": 142,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Asimov hesitates for a while before speaking again."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 143,
        "ActionId": 143,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "This is just my hypothesis. There isn't enough evidence to support it.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 144,
        "ActionId": 144,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "So far, Lucia is the only one displaying these symptoms, because her frame data and M.I.N.D. bottom structure both come from the same provider.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 145,
        "ActionId": 145,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "While other specialized frames were also developed from the data of Ascendants and agents, they had different M.I.N.D. bottom structures.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 146,
        "ActionId": 146,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "That is why specialized frames must be adjusted first before Constructs can use them.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 147,
        "ActionId": 147,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "Which leads me to suspect the signal source can possibly be Alpha's M.I.N.D. activities.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 148,
        "ActionId": 148,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hassen",
            "Possibly... Why can't you be sure of that? We should be able to compare it against the sample of Alpha's M.I.N.D. activities.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 149,
        "ActionId": 149,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "I already did. The signal waves didn't fully overlap.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 150,
        "ActionId": 150,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "The data is out of date. The chance of M.I.N.D. signals changing is quite low, but it is not zero.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 151,
        "ActionId": 151,
        "Type": 202,
        "Params": [
            2,
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 152,
        "ActionId": 152,
        "Type": 201,
        "Params": [
            2,
            500012,
            "",
            400
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 153,
        "ActionId": 153,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Nikola",
            "Maybe we will meet more than just Ascendants there.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 154,
        "ActionId": 154,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Ever since Asimov marked the approximate location of the signal source, Nikola has been looking at his terminal, trying to confirm something."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 155,
        "ActionId": 155,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nikola",
            "Remember the Scarlet Revelation members who went missing?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 156,
        "ActionId": 156,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hassen",
            "From what I remember, the Purifying Force was investigating it and found out Kurono's Project Winter and Ascendants were behind their disappearance. Is that right?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 157,
        "ActionId": 157,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nikola",
            "Those believers were originally placed in the Forsaken camp. The Forsakens had also been searching for them after they were gone.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 158,
        "ActionId": 158,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nikola",
            "Not long ago, we received an important message from Watanabe. It contained some information regarding the handover of those kidnapped believers.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 159,
        "ActionId": 159,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nikola",
            "The Forsakens proposed a joint operation to find out what was going on.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 160,
        "ActionId": 160,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nikola",
            "The Purifying Force set up a trap to capture a few suspects involved in the handover. With the information from undercover agents, we managed to deduce a few locations.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 161,
        "ActionId": 161,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nikola",
            "And Asimov just circled one of them.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 162,
        "ActionId": 162,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hassen",
            "I don't think they would do something so high-profile.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 163,
        "ActionId": 163,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nikola",
            "Which means if they were the reason for Lucia's problem, something must have gone out of their control.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 164,
        "ActionId": 164,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nikola",
            "That's good news to us. The more they are preoccupied, the more weaknesses they will expose.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 165,
        "ActionId": 165,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hassen",
            "Are you planning to use Lucia to find out this signal source?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 166,
        "ActionId": 166,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsEnd": 1,
        "EndAnim": "AniZhuanchangBegin",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Nikola",
            "That's right. Whether this source comes from Ascendants or Kurono's out-of-control research, it is worth finding out.",
            2
        ]
    }
]